If you have unlimited teleportation capability (and teleport control),
that is, you can ^T without limit, then when satiated, you can keep
on doing ^T until you're no longer satiated.  I'm not sure but I
think a single ^T uses up 60 food units (for reference, a food ration
has 800 units, a gaint corpse about 400-500 units, a large dragon
corpse about 1500 units).

